  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large paella pan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and saute for another minute.",
    "Add the scotch bonnet peppers, thyme, allspice, salt, and black pepper, and stir well.",
    "Add the sorted and rinsed yellow split peas and stir to combine with the spice mixture.",
    "Add the water to the paella pan and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes or until the peas are tender.",
    "Serve the paella hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
